WEBVTT

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:04.889
A physical lunch requires several separate confirmations A business

00:00:04.955 --> 00:00:07.652
decision in favour of a physical lunch does not

00:00:07.731 --> 00:00:14.192
establish protective arrangements transport or monitoring acceptance Daniel keeps

00:00:14.244 --> 00:00:17.823
each condition visible and obtains confirmation from the appointed

00:00:17.889 --> 00:00:22.810
owner Existing afternoon arrangements do not automatically cover the

00:00:22.863 --> 00:00:23.850
